SPRINT P1 — CRITICAL
C-1: Unoptimized Sanity image URLs

Issue: Full-resolution images served to every viewport.

Impact: LCP, bandwidth.

C-2: 2MB PNG catalogue nav images preloaded

Issue: Large, unoptimized images blocking initial render.

Impact: LCP, bandwidth.

C-3: fractal_ring.webp via CSS bg × 4

Issue: Unoptimized background images that are not lazy-loaded.

Impact: Render blocking, bandwidth.

C-4: Stega always enabled in production

Issue: Visual editing metadata active in live environment.

Impact: Server CPU, payload size.

C-5: 9 sequential Sanity fetches — waterfall

Issue: Requests firing one after another instead of simultaneously.

Impact: TTFB, FCP.

SPRINT P2 — HIGH
H-1: 1.47MB dead PNG imports in JS chunks

Issue: Unused assets bloating the JavaScript bundle.

Impact: Bundle size, JS parse time.

H-2: Header hardcodes stale auth state

Issue: Incorrect user authentication display on load.

Impact: UX correctness, CLS.

H-3: react-multi-carousel unused in prod bundle

Issue: Dependency included in build despite no usage.

Impact: Bundle size.

H-4: styled-components SWC overhead unused in store

Issue: Compiler processing styled-components unnecessarily.

Impact: SSR overhead.

H-5: Geist fonts in app/fonts/ — orphaned

Issue: Files present in repository but never loaded.

Impact: Repo hygiene.

SPRINT P3 — MEDIUM
M-1: Double priority preload on Hero

Issue: Preloading both mobile and desktop hero images simultaneously.

Impact: LCP, wasted bandwidth.

M-2: IemCard priority on below-fold images

Issue: High priority assigned to images not immediately visible.

Impact: LCP competition.

M-3: No per-section cache tags

Issue: Impossible to perform surgical revalidation.

Impact: Cache efficiency.

M-4: Clerk middleware runs on public home page

Issue: Middleware execution on routes that don't require auth.

Impact: Cold-start latency.

M-5: netlify.toml overrides Next image cache headers

Issue: Configuration conflict with Next.js native optimization.

Impact: Cache correctness.

M-6: CatalogueNavbar fill images missing sizes prop

Issue: Images requested at incorrect dimensions.

Impact: Oversized image requests.

